-*   `GTO_ISO_DFORM`: Enable D form (densities as $\phi^T D \phi$). Default: Off [S1, unofficial].
-*   `GTO_ISO_FLOOD`: Enable flood approximation. Default: 1 (On) [S1, unofficial].
